# CLK-06 production reader (source-only preparation)

Five new reader modules reuse the unchanged C6 unit reader's seven modules,
Header's held production workflow04 four modules, and the authenticated metadata
utility. The manifest lists all 17 exact executable dependencies. No module has
been imported or executed, and no numerical result payload has been read during
authoring. Diffs against the historical C5 production reader are source lineage,
not an assertion that the two cards select the same fields.

## Required independent source review

Schema: `clk06-independent-production-comparer-source-review.v1`.
Status: `pass-held-production-reader-and-frozen-input-policy-before-six-cli`.
The actual recorded full-JSON review must contain exact17 `reviewed_sources`
rows (`historical_path`, `archive`), `executed_reader_source_archive`, actual
aware UTC review interval, `scientific_execution_performed:false`, and these
direct authenticated refs:

- `reviewed_native_admission_contract`
- `reviewed_run_design`
- `reviewed_transport_source_inventory`
- `reviewed_root_preoutput_decision`

The source reviewer must read the actual source and frozen input policy; static
authoring metadata is not a scientific certificate. Baseline authored these
five modules, the candidate observer and earlier hourly/producer algorithms.
Header's source review and Raw's factual result review disclose their own
earlier helper, wrapper and numerical-source authorship separately.

## Root-only future commands

`python -X utf8 -B freeze_projection.py --native-admission-contract ADMISSION --source-review REVIEW --source-review-execution REVIEW_COMMAND --output-dir FRESH_FREEZE`

This writes `projection.json` with schema
`clk06-production-comparison-projection.v1`. SourceQA0 must precede freeze0,
which must precede the actual input plan and all six CLI children. It reads no
native numerical result. Its stdout is exactly the projection ref plus the
three input-only/no-science/no-gates flags declared in the source.

Header workflow04 prepares the input plan and executes exactly the existing
A-24H/A-72H/B-BOTH-24H Full/Summary calls. Its actual matrix and recorder are
runtime inputs; no future output identity or successful result is assumed.

`python -X utf8 -B check_production.py --matrix MATRIX --matrix-execution MATRIX_COMMAND --comparison-projection PROJECTION --comparison-projection-execution FREEZE_COMMAND --output-dir FRESH_RESULT`

This writes `production-comparison.json`, schema
`clk06-production-comparison.v1`, and prints that complete JSON. Exit0 requires
zero comparison mismatches; all real failure ledgers remain available. Pass
status is `pass-selected-sky-and-owned-production-transport`; failure status is
`fail-selected-sky-or-owned-production-transport`.

## Frozen comparison boundary

The Root six profiles and nine tolerance rows are copied unchanged. Production
pairs Today sky4, cloud histories/counts, stored weights and actual owned sky/IR
copies. Direct ESky17 remains a separate genuine unit-QA operand; no production
ESky metric is invented. All three genuine Original production histories contain
963 direct GetNext/Initialize/Current calls, including 480 Current calls. Actual
nested reads derive from effective BeginEnvrn and BeginDay/prefetch flags; A72
day-boundary read distribution is 2/1/0, with no invented completion ordinal.

Each Full run pairs whole direct before/after history; both Full/Summary pair
all eight actual transport kind ledgers and actual occurrence order, stamps,
caller sites and explicit solve/report-outside-face origins. No deduplication,
truncation or one-sided required absence can count as PASS. Conditional resolved
and report-recompute kinds may genuinely have zero invocations; those remain
unavailable/noPASS, and every executed argument is required. Hourly sums/means
are observed distinctly; no native report aggregate or weather RHS is rebuilt.
Actual pushed values are paired to the real OutputSeries handoff copies.

Native Current sky5, prepared model owners, Current13 physics, cross-native
CurrentTime/SimTimeSteps, fallback formulas and SRC08 coefficients/fluxes remain
unpaired. No native answers are supplied to Rust. Exact six-run source/cap design
and actual compiled surface identities bound the collector scope; generic user
runtime settings are not certified. The source-held manifest is not an execution
receipt, final card closure or gate update.

## Preserved first execution and fresh source policy

The actual first comparer failed before emitting a report because its owned
context caller expected the immediate callee rather than the propagated
`#[track_caller]` source `heat_balance/weather_driver.rs:75`. Its actual exit1
receipt and empty stdout remain preserved. SourceQA01 did not catch that alias.
Fresh02 uses exactly that compiled caller and `series.current_for(` marker.

The projection freezes `selection.transport_mask.source_origin_policy` with
eight exact compiled source identities and explicit per-case branches. A's
hourly SimplifiedAnalytical route requires both positive ingress origins.
B's fixed direct route inherits quick outside and cached report returns, so
surface solve is positive and the three declared report-origin keys are exactly
zero. Those uninvoked roles remain unavailable/noPASS; every executed argument
retains the existing required comparison. Compiled source archives must match
the policy SHA identities and source markers. No numeric profile, tolerance,
weather operand or numerical selection changed. Fresh SourceQA0 and freeze0
must precede a fresh six-run plan/matrix; matrix01 cannot satisfy that chronology.
